================================================================================
Derivative work and attributions
================================================================================

ft8.rs's FT8 decoder is a derivative of the WSJT-X and JTDX decoders: the
routines under

    crates/ft8rs-core/src/decode/lib_wsjtx/
    crates/ft8rs-core/src/decode/lib_jtdx/

are a function-by-function Rust port of the corresponding Fortran sources. Each
ported file carries a "Source mapping" / "Mirrors" header naming the upstream
file it was translated from. A translation of source code is a derivative work
under copyright law, so the GNU General Public License applies regardless of the
change of programming language.

